Package: geo-split
Version: 0.8.6
Architecture: all
Maintainer: 0xkee
Depends: keenetic-entware-extras, geo-split-data, ip-full, curl, bind-dig, aggregate
Recommends: jq
Description: Split routing by GeoIP subnets and domain lists for Keenetic/Entware.
 Route traffic through different network interfaces based on country IP zones
 and curated domain lists. Configurable via ROUTE_OUT (target interface) and ROUTE_IN (LAN sources).
 Uses ip rule + ip route (no iptables fwmark) for Keenetic NDM compatibility.
Section: net
Priority: optional
